 "synopsis": "Carlsberg India has received Securities and Exchange Board of India observations for an initial public offering of approximately $700 million, amounting to about ₹6,600 crore. The IPO will involve a stake sale by its parent entity, the Carlsberg Group, which filed a confidential draft red herring prospectus in July. The company joins other multinational corporations seeking to list in India's active IPO market.",
